OL,12,G0310 Britain's Hotel Murders
OL,13,     F...Hotel Murders. A chilling phone
OL,14,     Fcall at a hotel sets off a series
OL,15,     Fof bizarre events. A body found on
OL,16,     Fa bed and a handwritten note point
OL,17,     Fto suicide but police investigate
OL,18,     Fa baffling mystery.
